</div>          </div>          <div n="1" type="jPoliticalNews">             <div n="2" type="jArticle" xml:id="scutari2" prev="#scutari1">                <p>diesbezüglich aus Scutari ge&#x017F;chrieben: &#x201E;Während<lb/>
